Article (17)
The following Vehicles will be exempt from the Traffic Toll fees:
1. Vehicles of societies and centres for people with special needs;
2. Vehicles of the Awqaf and Minors Affairs Foundation in Dubai;
3. Vehicles intended for use by persons with special needs; and 4. buses used for transportation of staff and workers, in accordance with the requirements prescribed by the RTA.

