answer:
The Dubai Airports Departure Fee is **seventy-five dirhams (AED 75.00)** for every passenger departing the United Arab Emirates through Dubai airports. The following passengers are exempt from paying this fee:
- Passengers below the age of two (2) years;
- On-duty pilots and cabin crew;
- Transit passengers whose arrival and departure flight number is the same;
- Transfer passengers whose final destination is not the United Arab Emirates and whose departure is within twenty-four (24) hours from the time of arrival.

